an:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.degH2_surjective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.degH2_surjective","kind":"theorem","line":348,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L348-L350","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.deg_faceCocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.deg_faceCocycle","kind":"theorem","line":342,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L342-L346","doc":"**The degree is onto** when no point lies in all four sets. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.faceCocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.faceCocycle","kind":"def","line":323,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L323-L340","doc":"The 2-cocycle with value `g` on the oriented face `(1,2,3)` and `1` elsewhere,\nwhen no point of `X` lies in all four sets. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.cover_of_allDistinct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.cover_of_allDistinct","kind":"theorem","line":319,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L319-L320","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.tri_cocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.tri_cocycle","kind":"theorem","line":316,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L316-L317","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.tri","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.tri","kind":"def","line":310,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L310-L314","doc":"The oriented incidence of the triple `(i,j,k)` with the face `{1,2,3}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kummerSurfaceData_tet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.kummerSurfaceData_tet","kind":"def","line":286,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L286-L305","doc":"**`KummerSurfaceData` at the level of one cover.** On any space carrying a\n`TetCover`, with the tetrahedral cover as the only admissible cover, the degree\nmaps exist and have the required properties. This is a statement about the\ncover, NOT about the colimit over all open covers (step C2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.degCech_eq_one_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.degCech_eq_one_iff","kind":"theorem","line":273,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L273-L282","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.degCech_map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.degCech_map","kind":"theorem","line":262,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L262-L271","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.degCech","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.degCech","kind":"def","line":257,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L257-L260","doc":"The degree on the colimit `Ȟ²` when the only admissible cover is the\ntetrahedral one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.tetCover_cof","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.tetCover_cof","kind":"theorem","line":253,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L253-L255","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.tetCover","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.tetCover","kind":"def","line":249,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L249-L251","doc":"The tetrahedral family as a cover of `X` (indices `Fin 4`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.deg_map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.deg_map","kind":"theorem","line":243,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L243-L246","doc":"The degree is natural in the coefficients. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.degH2_eq_one_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.degH2_eq_one_iff","kind":"theorem","line":227,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L227-L239","doc":"**The degree detects the class.** On a `TetCover`, a class in `H²` is\ntrivial exactly when its degree is `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.degH2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.degH2","kind":"def","line":223,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L223-L225","doc":"The degree on `H²` of the cover. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.exists_coboundary_of_deg_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.exists_coboundary_of_deg_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":194,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L194-L220","doc":"**Degree one forces a coboundary.** A 2-cocycle of degree `1` is the\ncoboundary of the constant 1-cochain `(i,j) ↦ c(0,i,j)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.constOneCochain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.constOneCochain","kind":"def","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L189-L192","doc":"The constant 1-cochain with values `w i j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.deg_rel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.deg_rel","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L167-L186","doc":"The degree is invariant under coboundaries. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.deg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.Cech.deg_one","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/CechNerveTetrahedron.lean#L164-L165","signatureChunk":0},{"@